/A 1842 0 R
/Alt (Line graph: Sentinel-2 Indicator Comparison for Demolition in Wajima City, June 2023-July 2025. X-axis: months/years. Left Y-axis: NDVI/NDBI \(0.0-1.0\). Right Y-axis: PL \(0-35\). Legend: NDVI Target, NDBI Target, PL Target, NDVI Control, NDBI Control, PL Control. Red dotted line: EQ 2024-01-01. Light blue shaded area: Public demolition, July 2024-May 2025. NDBI Target \(solid gray squares\) increases from 2023-06 to 2024-06, then fluctuates with a peak around 30 \(2024-10\) and a dip around 20 \(2025-01\), rising sharply to over 30 by 2025-07. NDBI Control \(dashed gray crosses\) stable between 15-20 until 2024-06, then slight increase/fluctuation, ending around 25. NDVI Target \(solid green circles\) decreases from 2023-06 to 2024-02, then fluctuates between 0.0-0.2, ending around 0.05. NDVI Control \(dashed green crosses\) similar decreasing trend, fluctuating between 0.05-0.2, ending around 0.1. PL Target \(solid orange circles\) fluctuates between 0.0-0.2, slight increase around 2024-06, then fluctuates between 0.05-0.1, ending around 0.05. PL Control \(dashed orange crosses\) stable between 0.15-0.2 until 2024-06, then fluctuates between 0.05-0.15, ending around 0.1.)
