/Alt (The line graph shows Sentinel-1 coherence comparison for demolition in Wajima City from July 2023 to July 2025. The horizontal axis is Date, ranging from 2023-07 to 2025-07. The vertical axis is Coherence, ranging from 0.0 to 1.0. Two data series are plotted: Wajima Target, represented by blue circles connected by a solid line, and Wajima Control, represented by orange crosses connected by a dashed line. Both lines generally remain near 1.0 from 2023-07 to early 2024-01. A vertical dotted red line at 2024-01-01 is labeled EQ 2024-01-01. Immediately after this line, both series drop sharply, with Wajima Target reaching a low of approximately 0.1 and Wajima Control reaching approximately 0.2. Wajima Control then recovers quickly to above 0.9 by late 2024-01 and remains high. Wajima Target shows a more gradual recovery, fluctuating between 0.5 and 0.9. A shaded blue region from approximately 2024-07 to 2025-05 is labeled Public demolition. Within this region, Wajima Target shows significant drops, reaching lows near 0.25 in late 2024-09 and below 0.3 in early 2025-03. After the shaded region, Wajima Target recovers to above 0.9.)
/K 12
/P 42 0 R
/Pg 20 0 R
/S /Figure
/Type /StructElem
