/Alt (The line graph shows Sentinel-2 indicator comparisons for construction in Suzu City from June 2023 to July 2025. The horizontal axis represents time from 2023-06 to 2025-07. The left vertical axis is labeled NDVI slash NDBI, ranging from minus 0.2 to 1.0. The right vertical axis is labeled PL, ranging from 0 to 50. Six data series are plotted: NDVI Target, NDBI Target, PL Target, NDVI Control, NDBI Control, and PL Control. A red dotted vertical line at 2024-01-01 marks EQ 2024-01-01. A shaded vertical rectangle from approximately 2024-03 to 2024-07 indicates the Construction period. The NDVI Target series \(solid green circles\) generally decreases from 0.55 in 2023-07 to 0.1 in 2024-04, then increases to 0.45 in 2025-07. The NDBI Target series \(solid orange squares\) fluctuates between minus 0.2 and 0.1. The PL Target series \(solid gray circles\) generally increases from 25 in 2023-07 to 45 in 2025-07. The NDVI Control series \(dashed green x marks\) generally decreases from 0.5 in 2023-07 to 0.2 in 2024-04, then increases to 0.3 in 2025-07. The NDBI Control series \(dashed orange x marks\) fluctuates between minus 0.2 and 0.1. The PL Control series \(dashed gray x marks\) generally increases from 25 in 2023-07 to 35 in 2025-07.)
