/Alt (The line graph displays Sentinel-1 backscatter coefficients in dB on the vertical axis against Date on the horizontal axis, ranging from 2023-06 to 2025-07. Four data series are plotted: VV Target as a solid line with circles, VV Control as a dashed line with crosses, VH Target as a solid line with squares, and VH Control as a dashed line with triangles. A vertical dotted red line marks EQ 2024-01-01. A shaded purple vertical band indicates the Construction period from approximately 2024-03 to 2024-07. The VV Target series generally fluctuates between minus 10 dB and 5 dB, showing an increase during the Construction period and then a decline. The VV Control series remains relatively stable, fluctuating between minus 10 dB and minus 15 dB. The VH Target series generally fluctuates between minus 15 dB and minus 20 dB, showing a slight increase during Construction. The VH Control series remains stable, fluctuating between minus 15 dB and minus 20 dB. Overall, VV Target shows the most significant change, particularly during the Construction period.)
